msgstr "아래의 모든 효과를 한 번에 설정합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:221 src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:527
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "사용자 지정"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:236
msgid "Effects preset"
msgstr "효과 프리셋"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:244
msgid "Concert hall"
msgstr "콘서트홀"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:247
msgid "Warm"
msgstr "따뜻함"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:248
msgid "Space"
msgstr "우주"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:249
msgid "Vocal cut"
msgstr "보컬 제거"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:258
msgid "Preamp"
msgstr "프리앰프"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:258
msgid ""
"Lowers the level before the effects and the equalizer, so boosts don't "
"distort"
msgstr "효과와 이퀄라이저 앞에서 레벨을 낮춰 부스트할 때 왜곡되지 않게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:259
msgid "Echo"
msgstr "에코"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:259
msgid "Repeats of the sound, fading"
msgstr "점점 줄어드는 소리의 반복"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:260
msgid "Vocal reduction"
msgstr "보컬 감소"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:260
msgid ""
"Takes out what is in the middle of the stereo image, usually the voice; it "
"also thins the sound"
msgstr "스테레오 이미지의 가운데, 보통 목소리를 줄이며 소리도 얇아집니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:261
msgid "Bass enhancer"
msgstr "베이스 강화기"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:261
msgid "Adds harmonics, so the bass is heard on small speakers and headphones"
msgstr "배음을 더해 작은 스피커와 헤드폰에서도 베이스가 들리게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:262
msgid "Exciter"
msgstr "익사이터"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:262
msgid "Adds brightness to the high frequencies"
msgstr "높은 주파수에 반짝임을 더합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:263
msgid "Stereo width"
msgstr "스테레오 폭"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:263
msgid "Spreads the stereo image"
msgstr "스테레오 이미지를 넓힙니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:264
msgid "Saturation"
msgstr "채도"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:264
msgid "Warmth, with a little distortion"
msgstr "약간의 왜곡이 있는 따뜻함"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:265
msgid "Limiter"
msgstr "리미터"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:265
msgid "A ceiling for the peaks, so loud parts don't clip"
msgstr "피크에 상한선을 두어 큰 부분이 찌그러지지 않게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:266
msgid "Compressor"
msgstr "컴프레서"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:266
msgid "Holds down the loudest parts, for an even level"
msgstr "가장 큰 부분을 눌러 레벨을 고르게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:267
msgid "Chorus"
msgstr "코러스"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:267
msgid "Copies of the sound, slightly out of tune, so it sounds thicker"
msgstr "약간 음이 어긋난 소리의 복사본으로 더 두텁게 들리게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:268
msgid "Flanger"
msgstr "플랜저"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:268
msgid "A short delay that sweeps up and down, like a jet passing"
msgstr "위아래로 오르내리는 짧은 지연, 지나가는 비행기처럼"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:269
msgid "Phaser"
msgstr "페이저"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:269
msgid "Sweeping notches in the sound, like a slow wah"
msgstr "느린 와우처럼 소리 속에서 움직이는 노치"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:270
msgid "Reverb"
msgstr "리버브"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:270
msgid "Adds the sound of a room"
msgstr "방의 울림을 더합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:272
msgid "Crossfeed"
msgstr "크로스피드"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:273
msgid ""
"For headphones: each ear hears a little of the other channel, as with "
"speakers"
msgstr "헤드폰용: 스피커처럼 각 귀가 다른 채널의 소리를 조금 듣게 합니다"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:281
msgid "Echo delay"
msgstr "에코 지연"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:281
msgid "Time between the repeats"
msgstr "반복 사이의 간격"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:282
msgid "Echo feedback"
msgstr "에코 피드백"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:282
msgid "How many repeats are heard, fading"
msgstr "들리는 반복 횟수, 점점 줄어듦"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:283
msgid "Room size"
msgstr "방 크기"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:283
msgid "Size of the simulated room"
msgstr "시뮬레이션하는 방의 크기"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:284
msgid "Damping"
msgstr "댐핑"

#: src/Windows/EqualizerWindow.vala:284
msgid "How much the highs fade in the room: more is warmer"
msgstr "방에서 고음이 얼마나 빨리 줄어드는지: 많을수록 따뜻함"

